Package: surveyBurden
Title: An R package for assessing the response-burden of web surveys
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Peter", "King", , "p.king1@leeds.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8550-466X"))
Description: This package tells you how burdensome your survey is. It works primarily with Qualtrics (.qsf export or API access), but can take your own question catalogue. Burden is scored using the GfS+ points scheme.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Language: en-GB
URL: https://github.com/pmpk20/surveyBurden
BugReports: https://github.com/pmpk20/surveyBurden/issues
